  "description": "“As long as he’s bigger than my husband. If he’s bigger than that…” \n\nShe got married young, at just twenty. After four years of one-sided love, all that remained was her husband’s affair. So she made a decision— to cheat back. Drunk out of her mind, she spends the night with a man whose face she doesn’t even know. But why are you worried about my husband ?\n\n \"Does your husband know you’re doing this ? Don’t you ever think about your husband ? Don’t you feel sorry for him at all ? \"\n\nSomehow, it turns into an affair entangled with her husband as well— Marriage Scam.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13486289), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/MarriageScam), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/marriage_scam), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4343003433), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000077411)     \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13486308), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/MarriageScam15), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/marriage_scam_15), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4343003434), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000077412)",
